  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=813334), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9980184)  \nCollege CC Jiyoung and Chanyul have been together since they were freshmen. After a small argument, Jiyoung angrily tells Chanyul that they should break up.\n\nFinals Butler Mo • The more you look at it, the cuter the background theme is\n\nwrong\n\nFeeling upset, Jiyoung gets drunk while drinking with her male friend Seunghyuk, and ends up posting a picture she took with Seunghyuk as a profile picture to show off. After she sobers up, she hastily deletes it, but Chanyul already misunderstands that it's a punishment for transfer... .",
